	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Das richtige Datum muss sich aus der unten in Z. 35 fehlerhaften Angabe "44." erklären können. Da unten in Z. 28-30 <persName ref="p8418" cert="high">Myconius</persName> eine Nachricht richtigstellt, die er in <ref target="file12904">Nr. 2855</ref>,12f, vom 21. März übermittelt hat, datiert vorliegender Brief vom 24. März - zu welchem Schluss auch <persName ref="p495" cert="high">Bullinger</persName> in seinem Brief an <persName ref="p8418" cert="high">Myconius</persName> vom 4. April <hi>1547 (Henrich, <persName ref="p8418" cert="high">Myconius</persName> BW 955,</hi> <ref target="file11113">Nr. 1070</ref>) gekommen ist.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mirum, cur ita luseris in literis<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Brief <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref> vom 19. März. - Vgl. <ref target="file12905">Nr. 2856</ref>,2.</note> per <persName ref="p4851">Froschoverum</persName> missis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cum enim eas ad me et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad <persName ref="p1278">Gastium</persName> inscripsisses et <persName ref="p4851">Froschoverus</persName> protinus mihi reddidisset, postquam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad finem legendo pervenissem, hęc invenio: <foreign xml:lang="de">„diß zeigend an d. <persName ref="p8418">Myconio</persName>“,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et paulo post: „Libenter scripsissem d. <persName ref="p8418">Myconio</persName>; nihil possum.“<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Nr. 2850,16. 17.</note></s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Coepi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ridere (ut qui mox videram errorem et lapsum memoriae)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, nam oblitus eras <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et mihi literas inscriptas!<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Die richtige Erklärung dafür ist eher in <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref>, Anm. 30, zu finden.</note></s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Volui hoc indicatum, ut et tu rideres.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Pręterea qui redeunt ad vos ex <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgo</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint sind die seit 1545 in <placeName ref="l311">Marburg</placeName> studierenden Zürcher Fabricius Montanus (<persName ref="p8009">Johannes Schmid</persName>), <persName ref="p6534">Karl Schweninger</persName>, <persName ref="p8469">Heinrich Hindermann (Opisander)</persName>, <persName ref="p20480">Hans Rudolf Funk</persName> und vielleicht auch <persName ref="p5838">Wilhelm Meyer</persName>; s. zuletzt <bibl source="b20">HBBW XVII</bibl> 428f, Anm. 59.</note> non fausta dicunt de Hesso.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Miror, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nisi forsitan, quae habet in animo, non vult esse nota.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ego de principe <ptr target="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"/>bon<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>am spem<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Fehlt in der Vorlage.</hi></note> concepi ab initio, ut mala de ipso non facile credam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Confirmat me, quod, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dum rogavit sententias suorum, quid in his turbis putarent sibi faciendum, et unus<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Unbekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ex his consuleret pacificandum cum cęsare<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note>, eundem pugnis satis contudit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Vi<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>detur enim mihi vir dei, qui a pace, qualem dat cęsar, abhorret.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Consentio <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>itaque non difficulter Augustano<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Unbekannt.</note>, qui scripsit: „O pacem, non pacem, sed multarum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>calamitatum parentem!“</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Non mirum igitur, abitum si minantur <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> et alii.<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. Nr. 2753,25f; <ref target="file12808">Nr. 2759</ref>,59f; <ref target="file12840">Nr. 2791</ref>,38-41; <ref target="file12888">Nr. 2839</ref>,15-19.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Sed papistę vicerunt, et pars longe maior victus<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Mit der "pars longe major" sind die Schmalkaldener gemeint.</note> est!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ferant igitur, quę libenter, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>imo nemine petente, receperunt.<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Kritik am Frieden, den die süddeutschen Städte mit dem Kaiser suchten.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>De <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName> nondum accipio praeter rumores, sed plane falsos.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quę vera <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sunt, expecto in dies.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p1560">Anglum</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p1560">John Hooper</persName>; vgl. <ref target="file12910">Nr. 2861</ref>.</note>, qui venit ad vos, habeto commendatum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Habet enim speciem pietatis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et doctrinę sanę; quamobrem dignum arbitror, ut cui a vobis bene fiat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8473">Uxor</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8473">Anne t'Serclaes</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>multo piissima est.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Vellem itaque maritum haberet per omnia respondentem; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quod dico non ob aliud, nisi quod non ita multis diebus cum eo familiaritatem con<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>traxi,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="15">Vielleicht an der kurz zuvor in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> gefeierten Hochzeit von <persName ref="p1560">Hooper</persName>; s. <ref target="file12910">Nr. 2861</ref>.</note> unde ad plaenum potuerim nosse ingenium viri.<pb type="edition" next="447"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Foedus, quo de a tergo literarum tuarum<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">In <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref>,22f. -Angesprochen ist die Nachricht von dem Bündnis, das die Hansestädte angeblich mit <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName>, <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName>, <placeName ref="l825">Dänemark</placeName>. <placeName ref="l2472">Polen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l749">Sachsen</placeName> geschlossen hatten.</note>, utinam ictum foret!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Non quod ita faveam foe<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>deribus pro evangelio, sed ut <persName ref="p18538">Carolus</persName> haberet, quos cogeretur timere, si forte <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>aliquando casurum esset istud „Plus ultra“.<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Die Devise von <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName>; s. <hi>Brandi, <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></hi> I 48f.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>De navibus quatuor non recte scripsi.<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">In <ref target="file12904">Nr. 2855</ref>,12f.</note></s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Venerunt ex nescio qua Indię parte <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>naves tot, onustę auro et argento, in <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniam</placeName>, et ex <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> pau<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>latim per mercatores importantur <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpię</placeName> in damnum Germanię.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Manet <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>tamen adhuc dubium, si ita sit, ob avariciam cęsaris incogitabilem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Qui<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Unbekannt.</note> hinc abierunt <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName>, nondum redierunt.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Adhuc ergo ignoro, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quid rei sit.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Plura non habeo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino cum tuis et <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>cui scribam, cum primum fuerit ocium.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 44.<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Richtig</hi> 24.: <hi>s. oben Anm. 1.</hi></note> martii anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimo, episcopo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>dignissimo, fratri ac domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>venerando suo.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Ti[guri]</placeName>.<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Textverlust bei der Entfernung des Siegels.</hi></note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
